<title>THAILAND: TABLE - Thai Petrochemical Q2 net jumps.</title>
<headline>TABLE - Thai Petrochemical Q2 net jumps.</headline>
<dateline>BANGKOK 1997-08-19</dateline>
<text>
<p>Six months ended June 30, 1997.</p>
<p>		  (in millions of baht unless stated)</p>
<p>				   Second quarter</p>
<p>				 1997			   1996</p>
<p>    Shr (baht)	     0.71	 vs		0.42</p>
<p>    Net		  1,241.97	 vs	    596.81</p>
<p>				   Six months</p>
<p>    Shr (baht)	     1.70	 vs		 1.34</p>
<p>    Net		  2,871.59	 vs	   1,834.17</p>
<p>Notes: Results are audited and consolidated. The company's full name is Thai Petrochemical Industry Plc, a petrochemical firm.</p>
